# Supply-Chain-Optimization-SQL
SQL-based analysis of supply chain data to explore customers, suppliers, products, orders, and business trends.
Supply Chain Optimization and Insights Using SQL

Project Overview

This project focuses on analyzing supply chain data using SQL to generate business insights related to customers, suppliers, products, orders, and order items.

The objective is to understand customer purchasing behavior, supplier performance, product demand, and order trends to support data-driven business decisions.

Project Objectives

* Analyze customer spending behavior.
* Evaluate supplier performance.
* Identify product demand patterns.
* Analyze monthly order trends.
* Identify inactive customers.
* Identify high-value customers.

Business Questions

1. Which customers contribute the most to total spending?
2. How can supplier performance be analyzed?
3. Which products have higher demand?
4. What are the monthly order trends?
5. Which customers are inactive?
6. Who are the high-value customers?

Database Entities

* Customers
* Suppliers
* Products
* Orders
* Order Items

Tools and Technologies

* SQL
* Relational Database Management
* Data Analysis
* Business Intelligence

Project Analysis

The project covers customer spending analysis, supplier performance analysis, product demand analysis, monthly order trends, inactive customer identification, and high-value customer analysis.

